{"id":"n49260-1-10","stage":5,"title":"소홀히 · 疏忽地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49260-1-10-1","ko":"어머니, 다녀오겠습니다.","zh":"妈妈，我出门了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀오겠습니다.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀오겠습니다","audio":"/audio/d7d7ddf5efb74343ca5f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aa53083b252fcd3f81ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49260-1-10-2","ko":"늘 조심하고, 엄마가 한 말들은 절대 소홀히 해서는 안 된다.","zh":"一定要小心，妈妈说的那些话绝对不能忽视。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}},{"text":"조심하고,","meaning":"小心，谨慎，留心","explanation":"조심하다：小心，谨慎，留心；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"조심하다","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62342","senseId":"1","lemma":"조심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조심하고","audio":"/audio/34bf55bb71499add82c9.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마가","audio":"/audio/2e1aa7412bb8a19dded5.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","explanation":"하다：承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"23","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"말들은","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말들은","audio":"/audio/3d7a00a8cc02227fcdff.mp3"}},{"text":"절대","meaning":"绝对，绝","explanation":"절대：绝对，绝","readings":[{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31702","senseId":"2","lemma":"절대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}},{"text":"소홀히","meaning":"疏忽地，大意地","explanation":"소홀히：疏忽地，大意地","readings":[{"term":"소홀히","audio":"/audio/33d5999d9112d2c4b7e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49260","senseId":"1","lemma":"소홀히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소홀히","audio":"/audio/33d5999d9112d2c4b7e7.mp3"}},{"text":"해서는","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서는","audio":"/audio/2bf0d1a4532f451a09da.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"된다.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된다","audio":"/audio/9eb981f7f181f49c6214.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"96a6023ce9edabaa","term":"늘","zh":"总，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3","entryId":"40481","definition":"无论什么时候都没变化，总是。","pronunciation":["늘"]},{"id":"0ae97bed98d1be70","term":"조심하다","zh":"小心，谨慎，留心","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3","entryId":"62342","definition":"为避免惹祸而注意言行。","pronunciation":["조ː심하다"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。；以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"0a8790a2dbe122f3","term":"절대","zh":"绝对，绝","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3","entryId":"31702","definition":"不管在什么情况下都必须。","pronunciation":["절때"]},{"id":"33d5999d9112d2c4","term":"소홀히","zh":"疏忽地，大意地","audio":"/audio/33d5999d9112d2c4b7e7.mp3","entryId":"49260","definition":"认为不重要，所以不够注意或尽心。","pronunciation":["소홀히"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definiti